OL,3,GNEWSARoad shut as fire engulfs
OL,4,Aabandoned static caravan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA static caravan that was left
OL,7,Falongside a busy trunk road for more
OL,8,Fthan a week has been destroyed by fire.
OL,10,FCrews were called to the A35 near
OL,11,FDorchester shortly after 01:00 GMT
OL,12,Fwhere the structure was well alight.
OL,14,FThe road was closed while 10
OL,15,Ffirefighters from Dorchester and
OL,16,FWeymouth tackled the blaze, which was
OL,17,Fout by 02:50.
OL,19,FNational Highways said the static
OL,20,Fcaravan had been left on the verge on
OL,21,FTuesday 20 October.
